        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T15:53:27.702Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "GTC Berlin&mdash; NVIDIA today introduced DSX POD , a reference design for complete NVIDIA Vera Rubin AI factories built by partners inside modular containers, integrated and validated before delivery.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-introduces-dsx-pod-ai-factories-to-accelerate-europes-infrastructure-deployment",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T09:34:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T15:53:27.702Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The units arrive ready to connect out of the box to a prepared site&rsquo;s power, cooling, networking and other supporting infrastructure, reducing deployment time from six months to as little as 14 days.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-introduces-dsx-pod-ai-factories-to-accelerate-europes-infrastructure-deployment",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T09:34:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T15:53:27.702Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "&ldquo;An AI factory creates value when it starts producing tokens &mdash; not when construction is complete,&rdquo; said Jensen Huang, founder and CEO of NVIDIA. &ldquo;With NVIDIA DSX POD, we&rsquo;re bringing factory-built precision and speed to AI infrastructure constructi…",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-introduces-dsx-pod-ai-factories-to-accelerate-europes-infrastructure-deployment",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T09:34:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T15:53:27.702Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA DSX POD brings Vera Rubin systems together with the infrastructure needed to operate them in repeatable, factory-built, containerized designs that partners can manufacture and deliver at scale.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-introduces-dsx-pod-ai-factories-to-accelerate-europes-infrastructure-deployment",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T09:34:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T15:53:27.702Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "It carries forward the design philosophy of the broader NVIDIA DSX&trade; infrastructure platform , with a distinct architecture that integrates and validates systems in purpose-built containers before transport and deployment.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/news/nvidia-introduces-dsx-pod-ai-factories-to-accelerate-europes-infrastructure-deployment",
        "source": "NVIDIA Newsroom (Press Releases)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-21T09:34:00.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-27T15:53:27.702Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA is working with Anduril, Armada , Bull, Crusoe , DayOne, Dell Technologies , Delta, Eaton, Foxconn (Ingrasys), GIGABYTE, HPE , Lenovo, Pegatron, Quanta Cloud Technology (QCT), Schneider Electric, Vertiv and Wistron to deliver DSX POD AI factories worldwide in early 2027.",
